      "writtenOn": "2022-10-13T22:57:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Volteer is the only project that has `CONFIG_CHIPSET_SLP_S3_L_OVERRIDE\u003dy`.  So adlrvpp_npcxx should have `CONFIG_CHIPSET_SLP_S3_L_OVERRIDE\u003dn`.  With the GCC build, I confirmed that build/adlrvpp_npcx/.config does not contain CONFIG_CHIPSET_SLP_S3_L_OVERRIDE.\n\nIs clang not optimizing out the code from the IS_ENABLED() check?",
      "parentUuid": "5c18b2e2_9f551d5a",
